        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RAGDORE — A Physics Sandbox Built Around Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/97f12edf002e919718a826df57d719de.poster.avif?t=1786528084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/97f12edf002e919718a826df57d719de.webm?t=1786528084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/97f12edf002e919718a826df57d719de.mp4?t=1786528084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🦴 <strong>Your body is part of the simulation.</strong> Break bones, lose limbs, get crushed, launched, stabbed, or blown apart — and the character dynamically adapts to the damage. Broken legs affect balance, missing limbs change movement, and every injury can completely change how you move through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 RAGDORE many sandbox maps at launch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Park</strong><br>A colorful playground filled with ramps, slides and objects made for high-speed ragdoll experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon Map</strong><br>An industrial physics testing area packed with machinery, traps and interactive hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water Park</strong><br>A sandbox environment with pools, obstacles and more ways to experiment with physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain</strong><br>A vertical environment built for long falls and high-altitude ragdoll experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City</strong><br>A larger urban sandbox with buildings, glass and plenty of places to create your own scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stumble Park</strong><br>A playground focused around balance, stumbling and physical character movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flat Level</strong><br>A clean open sandbox made specifically for building your own setups with the Spawner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Islands</strong><br>The largest RAGDORE map — massive floating islands, huge drops and plenty of open space for extreme physics experiments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.poster.avif?t=1786528084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.webm?t=1786528084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.mp4?t=1786528084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 There's <strong>no set goal</strong> – just raw experimentation and chaotic fun with physics-based destruction. No plot. No goal. Just chaos🙌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨 Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KINETRA Physics System</strong> – dynamic balance, stumbling, impacts and ragdoll reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully simulated damage</strong> – break bones, lose limbs and keep moving with injuries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Combat &amp; NPC Fights</strong> – punch, kick, knock down and fight NPCs using the same physical simulation as the rest of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic movement adaptation</strong> based on your character's physical condition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spawner Tool</strong> with a large selection of hazards, props and interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save &amp; Load</strong> your custom sandbox setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Music System</strong> – multiple music genres to match the chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grabbing and physical object interaction</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple sandbox maps</strong> built for different kinds of experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crushers, shredders, spikes, saws, explosives, trampolines and more</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SuperHero Mode</strong> with high-speed flight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person and Admin Eye modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive impact and body sounds</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.poster.avif?t=1786528084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.webm?t=1786528084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.mp4?t=1786528084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're launching your character into a shredder or crawling away without limbs, <strong>RAGDORE</strong> turns pain into pure entertainment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 Toys, Hazards &amp; Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shredders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circular saws</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive barrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trampolines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ramps and giant slides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rockets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab-able objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dummy NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many other spawnable physics objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/c1f16f65016b3507aaf05ae2710f95bc.avif?t=1786528084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras_big/c1f16f65016b3507aaf05ae2710f95bc.avif?t=1786528084 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>",
